  "description": "NetMetric.SystemIO.Windows provides a Windows-specific implementation of IProcessIoReader for capturing real-time process I/O metrics\n\t\t\tsuch as bytes read and written. It uses native Win32 APIs via P/Invoke to retrieve system-level I/O statistics, enabling observability\n\t\t\tof process-level data in .NET applications running on Windows.",
